{"version":1,"id":"dean-lewis-be-alright","title":"Be Alright","artist":"Dean Lewis","key":"Em","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/dean-lewis/be-alright/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Jon Hume and Dean Lewis","chords":[{"symbol":"G#m","canonical":"G#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[8,11,3],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"B","canonical":"B","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,3,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D#m","canonical":"D#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[3,6,10],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#","canonical":"F#","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,10,1],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#/A#","canonical":"F#/A#","keyboardPitchClasses":[10,1,6],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"   I look up from the ground to see your sad and teary eyes","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":29,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"   You look away from me and I see there’s something you're trying to hide","columns":74,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":27,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"  And I, reach for your hand but it's cold, you pull away again","columns":63,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"  And I, wonder, what’s on your mind-ind-ind","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":20,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"  And then you say to me “you made a dumb mistake”","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":19,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":" You start to tremble and your voice begins to break","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"You say the cigarettes on the counter weren’t your friends, they were my mates","columns":78,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"And I feel the colour draining from my face","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":3,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"And my friends said","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"   I know you love her but it’s over mate","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":24,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"   It doesn’t matter, put the phone away","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#/A#","column":22,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"   It’s never easy to walk away","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":19,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"   But let her go oh oh oh","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#/A#","column":17,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"   It’ll be alright","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"   So I asked to look back at all the messages you’d sent","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"   And I know it wasn’t right but it was fucking with my head","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"   And everything deleted like the past, yeah it was gone","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"   And when I touched your face I could tell you're moving on","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"  But it’s not the fact that you kissed him yesterday","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"It’s the feeling of betrayal, that I just can't seem to shake","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"And everything I know tells me that I should walk away","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G#m","column":22,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"But I just want to stay","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":14,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"And my friends said","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"   I know you love her but it’s over mate","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":24,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"   It doesn’t matter, put the phone away","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#/A#","column":22,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"   It’s never easy to walk away","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":19,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"   But let her go oh oh oh","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#/A#","column":17,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"   It’ll be okay","columns":16,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"  It's gonna hurt for a bit of time","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":20,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"  So, bottoms up, let’s forget tonight","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#/A#","column":18,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"   You’ll find another and you’ll be just fine","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"Let her go oh oh oh","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":12,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"But nothing heals","columns":17,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":12,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"The past like time","columns":18,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":10,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"And they can't steal","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":12,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"The love you’re born to find","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":16,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"But nothing heals","columns":17,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":12,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"The past like time","columns":18,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#","column":10,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"lyric","text":"And they can't steal","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G#m","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":12,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-40","kin